; cobalt_tile is the service-agnostic tile foundation: stable view identity, per-view
; capabilities, focus/capture and input routing, shared list navigation, and read-only
; text inspection (which lays text out with cobalt_core's Cell_layout). It must
; never depend on cobalt_error, cobalt_app, or any content source or producer: content
; adapters (in cobalt_screen) translate their domain to and from its opaque actions.
; Like cobalt_input it is terminal-independent.

(library
 (name cobalt_tile)
 (libraries cobalt_core cobalt_input core)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane)))
